{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"SUSE-SU-2026:4814-1","published":"2026-10-21T10:10:46Z","modified":"2026-10-21T20:02:14.077995319Z","related":["CVE-2026-46675"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-46675"],"summary":"Security update for libpng16","details":"This update for libpng16 fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-46675: Use-after-free of zlib input in `png_read_end` after incomplete zTXt, iTXt or iCCP decompression\n  (bsc#1283183).\n\nChanges for libpng16:\n\n- version update to 1.6.59 (jsc#PED-16190):\n * Fixed a regression introduced in version 1.6.47 that caused libpng to reject\n   hIST chunks in their correct position, after PLTE.\n * Prevented a double free of `png_struct` members after an allocation failure.\n * Applied fixes and updates to the CMake build.\n * Adopted the REUSE Specification for licensing the CI files.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libpng16","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Micro 5.3","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/libpng16&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Micro%205.3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.6.59-150000.3.28.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"libpng16-16":"1.6.59-150000.3.28.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:4814-1.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpng16","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Micro 5.4","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/libpng16&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Micro%205.4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.6.59-150000.3.28.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"libpng16-16":"1.6.59-150000.3.28.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:4814-1.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpng16","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Micro 5.5","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/libpng16&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Micro%205.5"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.6.59-150000.3.28.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"li